---
  <section class="chapter" id="shield" aria-labelledby="h-shield">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="ch-head">
        <div class="ch-tag"><span class="num">CH.IV</span><span class="rule"></span><span class="name">Shield</span></div>
        <h2 id="h-shield" data-scramble>Your documents stay yours.</h2>
        <p>Shipping documents carry your customers' names, cargo values and routes. This is how we handle them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="shield">
        <article class="guard"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 L9 17 L20 6"/></svg></div><div><h3>Human approval</h3><p>Nothing goes to a customer, carrier or customs without a person on your team approving it.</p></div></article>
        <article class="guard"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16"/><path d="M3 9 H21 M8 4 V9"/></svg></div><div><h3>Runs in your account</h3><p>Systems run in your company's own cloud account. You hold the keys and can see every connection.</p></div></article>
        <article class="guard"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10"/><path d="M8 11 V7 a4 4 0 0 1 8 0 V11"/></svg></div><div><h3>Least access</h3><p>We connect with the minimum permissions each workflow needs, and read-only wherever the work allows.</p></div></article>
        <article class="guard"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3 H19 V21 H5 Z"/><path d="M9 8 H15 M9 12 H15 M9 16 H13"/></svg></div><div><h3>Full audit trail</h3><p>Every document read and every action taken is logged, so any entry can be traced back to its source.</p></div></article>
        <article class="guard"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 L20 6 V12 C20 17 16 20 12 21 C8 20 4 17 4 12 V6 Z"/></svg></div><div><h3>Not used for training</h3><p>Documents are processed with Anthropic's Claude under commercial terms that don't use your data to train AI models.</p></div></article>
        <article class="guard"><div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 3 H17 L20 6 V21 H4 V6 Z"/><path d="M8 15 L11 18 L16 12"/></svg></div><div><h3>NDA before the audit</h3><p>We sign a mutual NDA before every audit, so you can show us real documents.</p></div></article>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-block">
        <div class="sub-h"><h3>Pilot terms that protect you</h3><span class="hud">We carry the risk</span></div>
        <div class="pledges">
          <div class="pledge"><span class="pk">01</span><h4>Measured baseline</h4><p>Before we build, we record your hours, turnaround and error rate. Results are measured against that, not claimed.</p></div>
          <div class="pledge"><span class="pk">02</span><h4>Pay on results</h4><p>We agree one target in writing. If the pilot misses it, you pay nothing for it.</p></div>
          <div class="pledge"><span class="pk">03</span><h4>You own everything</h4><p>Code, data and accounts are in your company's name. Leave anytime with full handover documentation.</p></div>
          <div class="pledge"><span class="pk">04</span><h4>Side by side first</h4><p>The system runs next to your team on real shipments, and your team approves every output until the numbers hold.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pack">
          <div>
            <p>Ask for my security pack before you share a single document.</p>
            <ul><li>Mutual NDA</li><li>Data processing agreement</li><li>Security questionnaire</li><li>AI provider list</li></ul>
          </div>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="#audit" data-bp="Security pack" data-wf="Something else" data-note="Requesting: the Phoenix World security pack (NDA, data processing agreement, security questionnaire answers).">Request the security pack</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
